<title>LATVIA: STABURADZE Q1 PROFIT 258,414 LATS.</title>
<headline>STABURADZE Q1 PROFIT 258,414 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staburadze confectionery on Tuesday said that its first quarter after-tax profit came to 258,414 lats on turnover of 2.088 million lats.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our first quarter profit is slightly higher than planned and it came to 258,414 lats,&quot; Mara Vecina, Staburadze's chief accountant, told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;Our first and fourth quarter results are usually higher than those of second and third which show lower turnover in the summer vacation period,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>Staburadze earlier said that it plans 1997 after-tax profit of 537,000 lats.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
